{"name": "ACS", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an underpaid employee trying to pay off your student loans at Joe's Freedom Burgers, the only Fast Food Joint where burgers are prepared authentically American with the use of firearms and firearms only. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/bb49affba1fd0c1dca5c36f58467e9ba.poster.avif?t=1772533418\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/bb49affba1fd0c1dca5c36f58467e9ba.webm?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/bb49affba1fd0c1dca5c36f58467e9ba.mp4?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your weapons to maneuver food around the kitchen. Each weapon has its own niche - try them all to find out what they're best at. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/7d3a6376506be5f1c0054833988c1d54.poster.avif?t=1772533418\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/7d3a6376506be5f1c0054833988c1d54.webm?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/7d3a6376506be5f1c0054833988c1d54.mp4?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you are cooking, your boss Joe Hannes is looking over your shoulder - and will routinely point out the mistakes you make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/c0a3bd137c71e7453ffbb1d1a1e03f6f.poster.avif?t=1772533418\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/c0a3bd137c71e7453ffbb1d1a1e03f6f.webm?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/c0a3bd137c71e7453ffbb1d1a1e03f6f.mp4?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quality matters - each time you deliver an order, you will get a rating from the customer. They're quite picky - to get the perfect S rank, you'll need to become one with your firearms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/134738594c836b4be61a7b0a27d08d12.poster.avif?t=1772533418\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/134738594c836b4be61a7b0a27d08d12.webm?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/134738594c836b4be61a7b0a27d08d12.mp4?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the shift, all your mistakes will be added together. If the customers at the end of the day aren't happy with your performance, you will be fired! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/a2e879da8f1bc708da1c0b43652b8dc4.poster.avif?t=1772533418\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/a2e879da8f1bc708da1c0b43652b8dc4.webm?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/extras/a2e879da8f1bc708da1c0b43652b8dc4.mp4?t=1772533418\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "What's more American than Fast Food? How about cooking it with guns! Switch between individual weapons to move ingredients, cook and deliver them to your customers before they lose their patience.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462040/header.jpg?t=1772533418", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "FPS", "Physics", "Funny", "Shooter", "Cooking"], "developers": "Freedom Burger Games", "publishers": "Freedom Burger Games", "release_date": "Feb 5, 2025", "price": "Free", "appid": "3462040", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "5 February 2025 - Free", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/TgvYWnPy_mM", "first_seen": 1738713600.0, "review_rank": 1860}